{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741230/extras/ExploreTitle.png?t=1747417234\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741230/extras/TwoWorldsGif.gif?t=1747417234\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No Rest for the Weary features two worlds, the real world and the mysterious Dream World. Although quite different on the surface, both worlds affect each other and present their own challenges to the main character, Joe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Joe needs to balance the stress of college life, dealing with his unresolved past, and figuring out more about the Dream World and its meaning. By making social connections in the real world and solving dungeons in the Dream World, Joe moves closer to understanding these two worlds and himself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo features the first school week. Meet new characters, explore the school, and introduce yourself to the Dream World in this exciting first week. You can also play through the same week making different choices to see how much changes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741230/extras/ShadowEndofPage.png?t=1747417234\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3741230?t=1747417234","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3741230?t=1747417234","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741230/ed1426a2dea686d6f40908253ab11cf9bb21f7f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747417234","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741230/ed1426a2dea686d6f40908253ab11cf9bb21f7f3/capsule_184